<title>FINLAND: ENSO'S 2004 BOND AUCTION RAISES FIM 417 MLN.</title>
<headline>ENSO'S 2004 BOND AUCTION RAISES FIM 417 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Postipankki on Thursday announced</p>
<p>the following result of the first tranche of forest industry</p>
<p>group Enso Oy's 2004 bond:</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Enso</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     15-03-2004</p>
<p> COUPON:				 6.00 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			6.05 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  99.703</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 417 MLN</p>
<p>Enso said earlier the maximum amount to be auctioned was one</p>
<p>billion markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 6805 0245</p>
</text>
